{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tainted Pools is a first-person liminal space survival horror game inspired by Backrooms lore. Explore the eerie poolrooms and corridors of Backrooms Level 130, where a stalking entity lurks in the shadows, drawn to every sound you make. Scavenge for resources and survive long enough to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomized item spawn</strong> \u2013 Resources and items change locations with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hostile entity</strong> \u2013 A terrifying entity hunts you, reacting to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited saves</strong> \u2013 Saving is only available at the hub room, adding risk to your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Semi-open world</strong> \u2013 Explore countless interconnected poolrooms and corridors.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568550?t=1745500033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568550?t=1745500033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/ee203b2337b5dbf37c214bad71be48d91a03c56d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745500033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/ee203b2337b5dbf37c214bad71be48d91a03c56d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745500033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tainted Pools is a first-person liminal space survival horror game inspired by Backrooms lore. Explore the eerie poolrooms and corridors of Backrooms Level 130, where a stalking entity lurks in the shadows, drawn to every sound you 